<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to target security forces and civilians across northern Nigeria, killing police officers in Borno, Plateau, Sokoto-Gusau and ambushing a convoy in Zamfara. They abducted a Plateau university student, a husband and five others in Benue, 14 students in Niger, and mourners transporting a corpse to Benue, while also kidnapping worshippers and schoolchildren in Zamfara and Kaduna. Bandits killed five police officers heading to a Zamfara APC primary and killed a boxer in an Okada rider dispute in Ibadan. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOMDM1RmpBNkxnX0pYMjllbDRRbWVEQi1pQ0hIeDZyelZrRVZBTDNZRHFZVXR4ZEQ5TkNjTmx0YnhWTDUwdkRxdDVGR0d0YzNSYzU2eWxlNUtYSlFZT3hvaXlMUEdXRzVHMkRJV3VLb0RvSm5tQTFtVTZWTzNDSXZRSENQRUlwZWZjQU1uTWZELUVpbGRVQ2djakp3V2w?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOam42V1NfVndwX0VlT1AxWUJvTllGdDFEQU5XSUlxcmw2elIwV0tNbmlLcWVwTmpxUHhkMXBzODlHT1ViamhiYjI1YjBvdjBtQ1E1V0RLWEJHeUFmeE1DdVJiRmNFM2wtcG9HREFQa2h1YjE0M3FXZTBDUmZrY0Q3c0hFcnpXSms?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE9NYjFXUl96dzg5YVhZR1gyZ1drTTVLdDI5eHFxcktpc1hnV2hXbUFjaWxLck56YmpBQ3ZTVU1KWVhCaUU5RThuWEhRd1pBNko0dnVXUy03SENocjhGNVZUOXdHT0xydUloRjFhQjEzZzIzZ28?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chronicle NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPdExPbE5UcmJQcTBCTk9nLTNOT053X3dobTdyT3hUS0c0Ykt0YUgtNVh6QUhiOXVPMDk4WUZOWkpSUmtyTVNKejF3Y1hMQWpRajEySEtSUmdmZENESVRUTFdyQjlRQ0pKVVRiMERuUzM4X09QbjMyazQ4MDhFMFo1VU1OWklsdW5SblNUVWVqLWhJeGgyQW5RN3ktSVA2TEpGeXQxVUt3TW5OOEZ6V0lhRXl2QWt2dw?oc=5&quot;&